{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685170/extras/5f1b96aa85e7c120a5089e85299e4e97.avif?t=1761142844\" width=1200 height=400 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685170/extras/3047085bcea8861d20d4602c531737be.avif?t=1761142844\" width=1200 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >_Earth Ten Days : 981Hz_\u00a0is a delightfully absurd interactive fiction game, blending quirky storytelling with player-driven choices.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Setting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685170/extras/4319d05158a31d2ccb2d00fd8f94d52a.avif?t=1761142844\" width=1200 height=100 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a future where interstellar travel is as routine as catching a bus, the universe has become a bustling hub of cosmic civilizations\u2014some brilliant, some downright bizarre.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On December 22, 2999, the Dutaf man, having bought Earth in a shady real estate deal, are set to &quot;rewild&quot; the planet\u2014erasing all human technology in the process.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Earth's final hours ticking away, music host Z's interstellar broadcast prepares to sign off... forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685170/extras/df3f984ef94fa5ef37d745323846fb02.avif?t=1761142844\" width=1200 height=600 /></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685170/extras/367f77db0cef257925988b2473097a02.avif?t=1761142844\" width=1200 height=100 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tune in to wild, funny, and unexpectedly profound calls from listeners across the galaxy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate conversations about love, society, existential dread, and why some aliens think human music is &quot;too loud.&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a cast of eccentric characters\u2014each with their own musical tastes, emotional baggage, and strong opinions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decide how Z's final broadcast ends. (No pressure.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685170/extras/46939d80176f1ade8088510a60320cac.avif?t=1761142844\" width=1200 height=600 /></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685170/extras/e2aef9143c857ff81e669a24182e6767.avif?t=1761142844\" width=1200 height=100 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to the stories of call-in radio guests and select different songs for them based on their musical tastes and preferences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each listener has unique preferences, requiring players to choose songs with varying moods, rhythms, and chords to match their needs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices shape the story, leading to multiple endings\u2014some hopeful, some heartbreaking, and some just plain silly.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685170/extras/594e4206e114fa4d6f699056fbe5413c.avif?t=1761142844\" width=1200 height=1800 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685170/extras/7d86ea870fe5296f6b4114f59064fab3.avif?t=1761142844\" width=1200 height=600 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Back to Basics","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3685170/e55c5fced6708710fe9848ecf7fa52ea0e2799d8.jpg"},{"name":"Power Couple","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3685170/f271848c3f523503421e8e67cf4e4e36ec88a180.jpg"},{"name":"Messenger of Love","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3685170/424d5c3d2cf129b3d741a41b4a6bbad2317fbe49.jpg"},{"name":"Bus Express","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3685170/651a2080b35c23932e0b7598bb3eba8c845784ce.jpg"},{"name":"Rising Star","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3685170/eaccd421d64f784cd456c29dd09e1eb9a207e1ae.jpg"},{"name":"Goodbye, Captain","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3685170/b6746595e15a7fa142fff97840767dcbed43bfa1.jpg"},{"name":"Embrace the Darkness","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3685170/f46fe590457173cea240a287a79b5c7a09ccf4e8.jpg"},{"name":"Fate of Fortune","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3685170/86bb80eb313c6bf53abcb255b0c8b8c1533e3b2e.jpg"},{"name":"The Great Journey","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3685170/99f0d7c0ba649c06d4d91dea6574d314f84de77d.jpg"},{"name":"Universal Voyager","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3685170/bcf6c2019f7e04899029ff537b6d9b30afbfee39.jpg"}],"total":36},"back